### 1. Health check (Unprotected)
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### 2. Metrics (Unprotected)
GET http://localhost:3000/metrics

### 3. Register a new custom user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tester",
  "password": "testpassword",
  "role": "staff"
}

### 4. Register - Validation Test (Should fail due to XSS injection attempt)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user<script>alert('xss')</script>",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "staff"
}

### 5. Login as Admin (Pre-seeded user)
# @name adminLogin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "adminpassword"
}

### 6. Login as Staff (Pre-seeded user)
# @name staffLogin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "staff",
  "password": "staffpassword"
}

### 7. Get Me (Auth test, replace JWT_TOKEN with the token from login)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN

### 8. Get Products (Without Auth - Should fail with 401)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products

### 9. Get Products (With Staff/Admin Auth - Replace JWT_TOKEN)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN

### 10. Create Product - Validation & XSS Test (Should fail with 400 validation error)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop <script>evil()</script>",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "quantity": 10,
  "price": 75000
}

### 11. Create Product - Success & Stock Alert Test (Create with quantity > 100 to trigger alert)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Large Stock Item",
  "category": "Office",
  "quantity": 150,
  "price": 200
}

### 12. Create Product - Normal Success (Replace JWT_TOKEN)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Standard Mouse",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "quantity": 30,
  "price": 1500
}

### 13. Update Product - Trigger Stock Alert (Change qty by > 100, replace PRODUCT_ID and JWT_TOKEN)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/products/PRODUCT_ID
Authorization: Bearer JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Standard Mouse",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "quantity": 160,
  "price": 1500
}

### 14. Delete Product as Staff (Should fail with 403 and trigger security alert)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/PRODUCT_ID
Authorization: Bearer STAFF_JWT_TOKEN

### 15. Delete Product as Admin (Should succeed, replace PRODUCT_ID and ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/PRODUCT_ID
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN

### 16. Get Audit Logs (Staff Auth - Should fail with 403)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer STAFF_JWT_TOKEN

### 17. Get Audit Logs (Admin Auth - Should succeed)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/audit-logs
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN

### 18. Get Security Alerts (Admin Auth - Should succeed)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/security-alerts
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN
